# CODEOWNERS — review is required from these owners for the paths below.
#
# Deliberately NOT a catch-all. Most of this repo is documentation, and requiring a
# maintainer review on every prose change is the kind of friction that gets a rule
# switched off. What is listed here is the security surface: the files where a mistake
# publishes something, or silently stops a control from working.

# The gate, its patterns, and its self-test. A change here can make the control inert
# while it continues to report PASS — the exact failure this repo has hit three times.
/boot-kit/scripts/            @token-boss

# The rule that defines what may be published at all.
/CONTENT-BOUNDARY.md          @token-boss

# CI config: a workflow change can disable the gate, or hand secrets to fork code.
/.github/                     @token-boss

# Enforcement that does not depend on the model choosing to comply.
/hooks/                       @token-boss

# The licence and the disclosure path.
/LICENSE                      @token-boss
/NOTICE                       @token-boss
/SECURITY.md                  @token-boss
